{{// Dynamic narrative gear-shifting (NEUTRAL, STEADY, DRIVE). Automatically steps up scene momentum when two quiet beats pass, preventing RP deadlocks.}}
{{trim}}
{{setvar::sola_opt_tempo::
## tempo agitator
goal: I shift scene momentum across gears so quiet beats never deadlock the roleplay.
* pick the gear: before writing, choose NEUTRAL (hold: advance nothing, resolve nothing), STEADY (one or two beats), or DRIVE (push and escalate).
* history decides: after two quiet or NEUTRAL turns, step up one gear. after a peak beat (confession, fight, reveal, entrance), step down one gear.
* neutral still moves: a NEUTRAL turn changes one concrete room detail (posture, floor-holder, topic, object state, light).
